<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Ireland's NTMA says 75 mln punt 5 yr tap exhausted.</title>
<headline>Ireland's NTMA says 75 mln punt 5 yr tap exhausted.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency said on Monday that a 75 million punt tap in the 6.5 percent bond due 2001 was all sold.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom + 353 1 676 9775</p>
